Scope of this grant
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Apache-2.0 grant covers the source code, documentation, experiment
scripts, trained model weights published in this repository (including
TFLite / ONNX / Keras artifacts under model/ and web/public/model/), and
the web/mobile client under web/, unless a nested NOTICE or LICENSE file
states otherwise. Nested packages under web/node_modules/ (not shipped in
git) retain their own licenses.

Training and evaluation audio corpora are NOT redistributed as part of this
repository by default. Their terms remain those of the original publishers
(see below). Obtain them separately using data/HOW_TO_GET_DATA.md.

