Third-party data (not licensed under this Apache grant)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

1) IRRI Rice Acoustic Sensor Dataset - pest class audio
   Balingbing C. et al. (2024). Application of a multi-layer CNN to classify
   major insect pests in stored rice detected by an acoustic device.
   Computers and Electronics in Agriculture, 225, 109297.
   Upstream: https://github.com/cbalingbing/Rice-Acoustic-Sensor
   Used for: rice weevil, lesser grain borer, red flour beetle training/eval.
   Terms: those of the original authors / dataset publishers.

2) Speech Commands ambient noise (Warden / Google)
   Used when preparing ambient windows for the clean class (not silence).
   Terms: those of the Speech Commands dataset publishers.

